--- Caveats ------------------------------------------------------------------
  - Prefix caching is disabled for every candidate. With it enabled the simulator's prefix-cache memory grows monotonically and the run dies on any device small enough to saturate (docs/deviations.md D12). Consequence: ServiceSpec.traffic.prefix_share_ratio has no effect on these predictions, and TTFT is pessimistic for workloads with genuinely shared prefixes.

